\newlabel{tab:phase4-2step}{{5}{18}{$2$-step diagnostic on SUMO bigger-bbox, seed=42, $T=20$. $2$-step covers $92.9\%$ of test transitions; the rest fall back to the $1$-step empirical conditional on either the first step or any unseen $(x_{t-1}, x_t)$ context}{table.caption.9}{}}
